WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.840
A dead satellite.

00:02.540 --> 00:07.685
This is Envisat, once the world's largest civilian Earth-watching satellite.

00:08.135 --> 00:15.142
Contact was lost in 2012 and it has circled since, eight tonnes with nobody at the controls.

00:15.592 --> 00:19.589
It is expected to stay up for about a hundred and fifty years.
